# Hash-pinned vendored conformance corpora keep their EXACT upstream bytes: each file's SHA-256 is
# pinned in a MANIFEST.sha256 asserted by a manifest test, and pinned refusal anchors are byte
# offsets into these files. The KML tree also mixes text with KMZ binaries, so end-of-line
# conversion is unsafe everywhere under it, not merely redundant; -text disables all conversion
# for exactly these subtrees.
test/Lumoin.Veritas.Tests/Geo/CiteGmlCorpus/** -text
test/Lumoin.Veritas.Tests/Geo/CiteKmlCorpus/** -text
